---
title: "Stop crawling at the chapter limit"
---
stateDiagram-v2
  state "Legend" as legend {
    lg0: Breaks NoPageFetchedAfterLimit
    lg1: Path to the NoPageFetchedAfterLimit bug
  }
  class lg0 breaks
  class lg1 bugPath
  s0: Page queued
  s1: Reading a page
  s2: Chapter accepted
  s3: Another page requested after the cap
  s4: Crawl finished
  [*] --> s0
  s0 --> s1: Fetch a candidate
  s1 --> s2: Collect its chapter
  s2 --> s3: Follow the Next link despite reaching the cap
  s2 --> s0: Check the next candidate or chapter limit
  s0 --> s4: No further chapter can be collected
  s1 --> s4: No further chapter can be collected
  s1 --> s0: Skip an unavailable secondary page
  classDef breaks fill:#ffecee,stroke:#e72e3b,stroke-width:2.5px,color:#cd2834
  class s0 bugPath
  class s1 bugPath
  class s2 bugPath
  class s3 breaks
  class s3 bugPath
